{"3919890": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Noko's Noodles", "steam_appid": 3919890, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4917550], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run a warm, cozy noodle shop in a dark, cyberpunk world. Make noodles, listen to your customers, put together jobs, and drive the story to spread your warmth through the world, or send it deeper into darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Welcome Home Soldier</i></strong><br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>CyCorp thanks you for your service!</i>   <br><i>In recognition of your sacrifice you will be allotted one bucket of Fish Offal a week. The spoils of war are indeed sweet!</i>   <br><i>Please report to your nearest CyCorp representative if you would like job placement in one of our fabulous facilities.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919890/extras/1fdeecdc9d46a0c3a7cf055c076f6900.avif?t=1785861368\" width=1350 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You run a cozy noodle shop in the dark, sterile, Neon city. Post-war rationing leave the world hungry, both for food, and for warmth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919890/extras/0e02f13df050c6cadc17ae930edcad61.poster.avif?t=1785861368\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919890/extras/0e02f13df050c6cadc17ae930edcad61.webm?t=1785861368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919890/extras/0e02f13df050c6cadc17ae930edcad61.mp4?t=1785861368\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919890/extras/3bbc8cce6f62ce148fc13fc861f76e86.avif?t=1785861368\" width=1350 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While the world is dark, rainy, depressing, and brutal, your little shop brings a rare warmth to the customers that visit. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can listen to their problems, their hopes, their secrets. Use this knowledge to make connections and drive the world from your cozy noodle shop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you push the world further into darkness, or will you spread your warmth past the walls of your shop?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919890/extras/3aaea59aebb863693361c8b87cc39413.poster.avif?t=1785861368\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919890/extras/3aaea59aebb863693361c8b87cc39413.webm?t=1785861368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919890/extras/3aaea59aebb863693361c8b87cc39413.mp4?t=1785861368\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919890/extras/e44b850aab4be4e1a734919c03c49967.avif?t=1785861368\" width=1350 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make excellent soup to earn excellent clientele. Those with influence will visit only the best shops, and if they have influence, you have influence. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn about their wants, needs, and secrets. Build your network of talented individuals to complete jobs in the city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919890/extras/6bfefecc578ac01505140ff2cb61739a.poster.avif?t=1785861368\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919890/extras/6bfefecc578ac01505140ff2cb61739a.webm?t=1785861368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919890/extras/6bfefecc578ac01505140ff2cb61739a.mp4?t=1785861368\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919890/extras/a04952ccb82585af1f2209500a776976.avif?t=1785861368\" width=1350 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use what you've learned to get your customers to do favors for each other. You choose the agenda, help out CyCorp, help the Uza gang, or simply make the best damn noodles in the city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919890/extras/114a7641732e88688961be624f60e98d.poster.avif?t=1785861368\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919890/extras/114a7641732e88688961be624f60e98d.webm?t=1785861368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919890/extras/114a7641732e88688961be624f60e98d.mp4?t=1785861368\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Features</u></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A warm noodle shop contrasting a dark cyberpunk world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Branching Story that drives the world Darker, Warmer, or simply Capitalistic.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Management of your little noodle shop.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Artistically arrange bowls of noodles for your favorite customers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story vignettes for major events in the world.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run a warm, cozy noodle shop in a dark, cyberpunk world. Make noodles, listen to your customers, put together jobs, and drive the story to spread your warmth through the world, or send it deeper into darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Welcome Home Soldier</i></strong><br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>CyCorp thanks you for your service!</i>   <br><i>In recognition of your sacrifice you will be allotted one bucket of Fish Offal a week. The spoils of war are indeed sweet!</i>   <br><i>Please report to your nearest CyCorp representative if you would like job placement in one of our fabulous facilities.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919890/extras/1fdeecdc9d46a0c3a7cf055c076f6900.avif?t=1785861368\" width=1350 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You run a cozy noodle shop in the dark, sterile, Neon city. Post-war rationing leave the world hungry, both for food, and for warmth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919890/extras/0e02f13df050c6cadc17ae930